    "finalName": "",
    "description": "Once per encounter, as a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Reaction\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Reaction\">Reaction</a>, you may make an <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Amphistaff\" title=\"Amphistaff\">Amphistaff</a> attack against a being whose attack you negated using the <b>Amphistaff Block</b> Talent. You cannot change the Form of the <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Amphistaff\" title=\"Amphistaff\">Amphistaff</a> prior to making this attack (meaning, the attack can only be made with the Quarterstaff or Spear Forms of the weapon).<br><br>Only non-area melee attacks can be riposted in this manner; you cannot use this Talent when negating the damage from melee <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Area_Attacks\" title=\"Area Attacks\">Area Attacks</a>.",
